## Altura de linha##


<style>
p { margin: 5px; }
</style>

<div class="col50p terminal example">
line-height: normal;


line-height: 1.5;



line-height: 80%;

line-height: 15px;
</div>
<div class=col50p>
<p style="width: 10cm; border: 1px dotted; line-height: normal;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</p>
<p style="width: 10cm; border: 1px dotted; line-height: 1.5;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</p>
<p style="width: 10cm; border: 1px dotted; line-height: 80%;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</p>
